{"html":"<p>荷兰米菲博物馆，秀一波世界各国人民心中的米菲兔。</p><p><br></p><figure><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-de9fe7268803da50a8b4145e7545521a_r.jpg?source=c8b7c179\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>蓝色的米菲</figcaption></figure><p><br></p><figure><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-358a333aa9ee9287112f67aea6c93c87_r.jpg?source=c8b7c179\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>绿色的</figcaption></figure><p><br></p><figure><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-e2efca1afa28735ad1e35cd0e1ed9e0b_r.jpg?source=c8b7c179\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>黑色大眼睛的</figcaption></figure><p><br></p><figure><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-6cd3004b2311e18995bec96be013ca87_r.jpg?source=c8b7c179\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>男性化大长脸并且略显忧郁的</figcaption></figure><p><br></p><figure><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-d6bb2e02290c5cdbebacf7465c15b0a2_r.jpg?source=c8b7c179\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>眼距宽脑袋被门挤了的</figcaption></figure><p><br></p><figure><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-fdf139534405437dcb07d48c1cbe1a09_r.jpg?source=c8b7c179\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>会飞并且有猪朋友的</figcaption></figure><p><br></p><figure><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-49356770c7b1ae3d2587a026dccdd3fa_r.jpg?source=c8b7c179\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>减肥失败并且依然乐观的</figcaption></figure><p><br></p><figure><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-8fc1ce3a9f3aebe4dded6b56a1d65633_r.jpg?source=c8b7c179\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>进化成猫的</figcaption></figure><p><br></p><figure><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-91347a7f1a839b46ec76de1719eef34b_r.jpg?source=c8b7c179\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>穿红裙裙子的</figcaption></figure><p><br></p><figure><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-f1a3b6de9e16c25737fd5de23c851c90_r.jpg?source=c8b7c179\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>长的像狗的</figcaption></figure><p><br></p><figure><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-d674af843a5dd3520a6dd136dbc20da3_r.jpg?source=c8b7c179\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>除了脑袋都是多边形的</figcaption></figure><p><br></p><figure><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-e5bf23c74a1195a52bad2003a06444f7_r.jpg?source=c8b7c179\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>耳朵加长版的</figcaption></figure><p><br></p><figure><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-fc05e63a8100c6193723088a1702b86c_r.jpg?source=c8b7c179\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>爱拍照的</figcaption></figure><p><br></p><figure><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-18216e2204bfb86a3fa0827b6d14bca2_r.jpg?source=c8b7c179\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>羽绒服版的（目测最好看的一个）</figcaption></figure><p><br></p><figure><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-dcf3a9216d446b7de04fe5b4e458f9d9_r.jpg?source=c8b7c179\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>受惊吓炸毛的</figcaption></figure><p>除了大家心中的米菲，还有一些其他的艺术作品。或抽象，或卡通，或浪漫，或极简。一会梵高一会毕加索。比如</p><figure><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-3bf7c4c71040b49f58d84e1d7af4048b_r.jpg?source=c8b7c179\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>眦着板牙猥琐的驴，应该是荷兰人的作品</figcaption></figure><p><br></p><figure><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-ed9fc5fbeafa407693838b9ee6162089_r.jpg?source=c8b7c179\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>萌萌哒学生妹儿，日本人的作品</figcaption></figure><p><br></p><figure><img src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-f8fb40d36af3a8ec634788981a5bc380_r.jpg?source=c8b7c179\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>外星人版的三毛，外星人画的？</figcaption></figure><p><br></p><figure><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-b896646f987840d3efe2089945d705b5_r.jpg?source=c8b7c179\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>pokemon和皮卡丘是好朋友？</figcaption></figure><p><br></p><figure><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-621469dcbd4d98fe07d35a6924dd8eb6_r.jpg?source=c8b7c179\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>emoji配大蜘蛛，谁能告诉我下边的日语自白啥意思？</figcaption></figure><p><br></p><figure><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-6faa89f34b354e81d9d10718841dc5a0_r.jpg?source=c8b7c179\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>发际线上天的神秘女子。手里拿的是啥？</figcaption></figure><p><br></p><figure><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-60993f47887c4948d680777c6075f2e5_r.jpg?source=c8b7c179\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>一个叫Serena的.....虫子/小姑娘？</figcaption></figure><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><figure><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-af5293f32fdecc2be6109f2f0b996efe_r.jpg?source=c8b7c179\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>章鱼精</figcaption></figure><p><br></p><figure><img src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-3111561287b1df5d3cc5d1c4d2e0e95d_r.jpg?source=c8b7c179\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>染发版小混混大头儿子</figcaption></figure><p><br></p><figure><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-cc01095c317b8aa571f5178bef9b4299_r.jpg?source=c8b7c179\" alt=\"\"><figcaption>pussy？</figcaption></figure><p>里面有我自己的一副。看到和各位小朋友的绘画水平旗鼓相当，我就放心了</p>"}
